  {
   "text": "中国的餐桌礼仪 Chinese Table Manners",
   "conf": 0.5,
   "bbox": [
    0.29264,
    0.24561,
    0.71124,
    0.26318
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "餐桌礼仪在中国人的生活中非常重要，你知道这些餐桌礼仪吗？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "bbox": [
    0.15116,
    0.27762,
    0.69961,
    0.29651
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "1.必须等到所有人到齐才可以开始吃饭。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "bbox": [
    0.14922,
    0.29932,
    0.50194,
    0.31982
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "2.一般由主人点菜。",
   "conf": 0.5,
   "bbox": [
    0.14729,
    0.32122,
    0.32364,
    0.34033
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "3. 吃饭时不要发出大的声音。",
   "conf": 0.5,
   "bbox": [
    0.14922,
    0.34424,
    0.4031,
    0.36337
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "4.吃米饭时筷子不能插在米饭里。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "bbox": [
    0.14922,
    0.36621,
    0.4438,
    0.38672
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "5.茶壶的嘴尽量不对着别人。",
   "conf": 0.5,
   "bbox": [
    0.14922,
    0.38808,
    0.4031,
    0.40698
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Table manners play a significant role in Chinese people's life. Do you know them？",
   "conf": 0.5,
   "bbox": [
    0.1531,
    0.4126,
    0.80039,
    0.43023
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "1. The meal is not served until all the persons arrive.",
   "conf": 0.5,
   "bbox": [
    0.15698,
    0.43311,
    0.56395,
    0.44775
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "2. The host usually orders the food.",
   "conf": 0.5,
   "bbox": [
    0.15504,
    0.45349,
    0.43217,
    0.46948
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "3. It is impolite to make noise when you eat.",
   "conf": 0.5,
   "bbox": [
    0.1531,
    0.47217,
    0.5,
    0.48837
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "4. Chopsticks cannot be inserted in the rice during a meal.",
